    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "22 Tramway Court is a superbly located two-bedroom townhouse just a short walk from Sutton DART Station, scenic promenade walks and the vibrant Sutton Cross. \r\n\r\nSituated in a quiet cul-de-sac of approximately 40 homes, No. 22 enjoys a sunny, private west-facing rear garden with the living space opening directly onto a patio are, ideal for outdoor relaxation.\r\n\r\nAccommodation includes a bright and spacious living/dining room with a feature fireplace, a separate kitchen, guest WC, two generously sized bedrooms and a main bathroom. Many neighbouring homes have successfully converted their attic space, offering excellent potential for future expansion.\r\n\r\nPerfect as a first-time buyer opportunity or for those looking to downsize, this home combines convenience, charm and future potential in equal measure.\r\n\r\nSutton offers exceptional connectivity, with Dublin city centre just 25 minutes away via DART. A dedicated cycle path also links the area to the city and the nearby Baldoyle to Portmarnock Greenway is ideal for outdoor enthusiasts. Promenade walks and Burrow Beach are within a 10-minute stroll, while Sutton Cross offers a range of amenities including shops, cafés, restaurants and healthcare facilities."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway: \r\nGuest w.c:\r\n0.85 x 1.45m\r\n\r\nKitchen:\r\n2.65 x 2.15m\r\nRange of floor and wall-mounted presses. Oven, hob, extractor fan. Plumbed for washing machine. Tiled splashback. \r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room:\r\n6.05 x 3.50m\r\nPatio doors to rear patio. Feature marble fireplace with solid fuel stove. Coving & ceiling roses.\r\n\r\nLanding:\r\nHot press\r\n\r\nBedroom 1:\r\n3.40 x 2.15m\r\nBox window. Range of fitted wardrobes. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2:\r\n4.15 x 3.25m\r\nFitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom:\r\n1.50 x 2.45\r\nShower cubicle with electric shower, wc, whb. Fully tiled floor and walls. Rooflight.\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nGarden with tiled patio.\r\nOne allocated parking space."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2 minute walk to Sutton DART Station\r\n5 minutes walk to Sutton Cross\r\nClose to all amenities\r\nGas-fired central heating\r\nDouble glazed timber framed windows\r\nWest-facing rear garden with patio area\r\nOne allocated parking space\r\nWell-appointed living accommodation"
      },
